flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T21:42:51.0301912Z ^[[32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T21:42:51.0309235Z ^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T21:42:51.0309603Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T21:42:51.0309964Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T21:42:51.0310097Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T21:42:51.0310233Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T21:42:51.0311007Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T21:42:51.0311170Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T21:42:51.0311457Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T21:42:51.0311700Z    if you are ready to continue.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T21:42:51.0311813Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T21:42:51.0312080Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T21:42:51.0312381Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T21:42:51.0312683Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T21:42:51.0312901Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T21:42:51.0312998Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T21:42:51.0313108Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T21:42:51.0313385Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T21:42:51.0313519Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T21:42:51.0313735Z    can use Nix.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T21:42:51.0313825Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T21:42:51.0313894Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T21:42:51.0313996Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T21:42:51.0314147Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T21:42:51.0314446Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T21:42:51.0318444Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T21:42:51.0318556Z I will:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T21:42:51.0318704Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T21:42:51.0318847Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T21:42:51.0319093Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T21:42:51.0319444Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T21:42:51.0319824Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T21:42:51.0320093Z  - install Nix in /nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T21:42:51.0320347Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T21:42:51.0320591Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T21:42:51.0320810Z    /root
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T21:42:51.0895832Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T21:42:51.0896388Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T21:42:51.0904745Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T21:42:51.0905064Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
